  "headExtra": "<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://videos.quickler.co\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@graph\": [{\"@type\": \"VideoObject\", \"name\": \"Graeme Clark, Ethos Safety: \\u201cA fifth, if not a sixth of the time.\\u201d\", \"description\": \"Graeme Clark, Director at Ethos Safety, on how little of the time goes on the task itself when you give Quickler a voice note and spend the rest of it with people.\", \"thumbnailUrl\": [\"https://videos.quickler.co/graeme-a-fifth-of-the-time-thumb.jpg\"], \"uploadDate\": \"2026-11-23\", \"duration\": \"PT22S\", \"contentUrl\": \"https://videos.quickler.co/graeme-a-fifth-of-the-time.mp4\", \"embedUrl\": \"https://quickler.co/graeme/\", \"inLanguage\": \"en-GB\", \"transcript\": \"Then think for three or four sentences and give that to Quickler as a voice note. And that is so efficient that we're maybe only spending a fifth, if not a sixth of the time actually doing the task. We spend the rest of the remaining time interacting with people, which is what we're there to do.\", \"publisher\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Quickler\", \"url\": \"https://quickler.co/\"}}, {\"@type\": \"VideoObject\", \"name\": \"Graeme Clark, Ethos Safety: \\u201cOn average, between five to ten minutes.\\u201d\", \"description\": \"Graeme Clark, Director at Ethos Safety, on how long it takes to edit a report in Quickler.\", \"thumbnailUrl\": [\"https://videos.quickler.co/graeme-editing-time-thumb.jpg\"], \"uploadDate\": \"2026-11-23\", \"duration\": \"PT23S\", \"contentUrl\": \"https://videos.quickler.co/graeme-editing-time.mp4\", \"embedUrl\": \"https://quickler.co/graeme/\", \"inLanguage\": \"en-GB\", \"transcript\": \"So now compared to before, the beauty with Quickler is we actually can see how long it takes to edit the report. It's taking, on average, between five to ten minutes. And some of this is actually because we've chosen to leave the activity of adding certain things until we go back to the office.\", \"publisher\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Quickler\", \"url\": \"https://quickler.co/\"}}, {\"@type\": \"VideoObject\", \"name\": \"Graeme Clark, Ethos Safety: \\u201cI wouldn\\u2019t hesitate to recommend it to anybody else.\\u201d\", \"description\": \"Graeme Clark, Director at Ethos Safety, on why he would recommend Quickler to anybody, and how people react when he shows it to them.\", \"thumbnailUrl\": [\"https://videos.quickler.co/graeme-recommend-it-thumb.jpg\"], \"uploadDate\": \"2026-11-23\", \"duration\": \"PT29S\", \"contentUrl\": \"https://videos.quickler.co/graeme-recommend-it.mp4\", \"embedUrl\": \"https://quickler.co/graeme/\", \"inLanguage\": \"en-GB\", \"transcript\": \"And the time that's saved is very useful time. I wouldn't hesitate to recommend it to anybody else. Everybody I've ever shown it to almost looks on with a gaze of wonder to say, oh, how is it doing that? As we said previously, it looks deceptively simple. And so it looks like an aspirational piece of technology that will take the hard work out of a repeatable, standardized task.\", \"publisher\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Quickler\", \"url\": \"https://quickler.co/\"}}, {\"@type\": \"VideoObject\", \"name\": \"Graeme Clark, Ethos Safety: \\u201cSo looking people in the eye and talking to them.\\u201d\", \"description\": \"Graeme Clark, Director at Ethos Safety, on spending the time that used to go on an iPad speaking directly to people.\", \"thumbnailUrl\": [\"https://videos.quickler.co/graeme-looking-people-in-the-eye-thumb.jpg\"], \"uploadDate\": \"2026-11-25\", \"duration\": \"PT37S\", \"contentUrl\": \"https://videos.quickler.co/graeme-looking-people-in-the-eye.mp4\", \"embedUrl\": \"https://quickler.co/graeme/\", \"inLanguage\": \"en-GB\", \"transcript\": \"We spent quite a lot of time focusing on the iPad, looking at the iPad, scrolling up, making these ticks in boxes or physically typing in boxes and taking a photograph for that topic. We're now spending that time speaking directly to people. So looking people in the eye and talking to them, having easier conversations because we're not slavishly following it because we know we've got a tool in our pocket or in our hand, which is much smaller because it's a mobile phone. And physically, we know that to capture the point of reporting, all we have to do is press a button, give it a voice note and send it.\", \"publisher\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Quickler\", \"url\": \"https://quickler.co/\"}}, {\"@type\": \"VideoObject\", \"name\": \"Graeme Clark, Ethos Safety: \\u201cReally working in the field without any sort of support.\\u201d\", \"description\": \"Graeme Clark, Director at Ethos Safety, on the moment Quickler really worked for his team in the field.\", \"thumbnailUrl\": [\"https://videos.quickler.co/graeme-when-it-really-worked-thumb.jpg\"], \"uploadDate\": \"2026-11-23\", \"duration\": \"PT35S\", \"contentUrl\": \"https://videos.quickler.co/graeme-when-it-really-worked.mp4\", \"embedUrl\": \"https://quickler.co/graeme/\", \"inLanguage\": \"en-GB\", \"transcript\": \"I think it was when we saw it really working in the field without any sort of support. And what I mean by that is we were able to do exactly the same as we did before report wise, but we were able to do it quicker and we were able to do it slicker. So what I mean by that is that we had the ability to actually generate a high quality report that needed very minimal admin or tidying up afterwards. And we were then able to bounce from that job to the next job.\", \"publisher\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Quickler\", \"url\": \"https://quickler.co/\"}}, {\"@type\": \"VideoObject\", \"name\": \"Graeme Clark, Ethos Safety: \\u201cIt\\u2019s a one and done, basically.\\u201d\", \"description\": \"Graeme Clark, Director at Ethos Safety, on finishing an inspection in one go and moving straight on to other tasks.\", \"thumbnailUrl\": [\"https://videos.quickler.co/graeme-one-and-done-thumb.jpg\"], \"uploadDate\": \"2026-11-23\", \"duration\": \"PT35S\", \"contentUrl\": \"https://videos.quickler.co/graeme-one-and-done.mp4\", \"embedUrl\": \"https://quickler.co/graeme/\", \"inLanguage\": \"en-GB\", \"transcript\": \"We're actually doing other work. So we're able to top and tail the inspection activity much quicker than we did before. So we're moving on to other tasks. So we're almost able to do them completely in exclusion of any other activity and then move straight on to something else. So there is no requirement to revisit the task. So it's a one and done, basically. So we're using the other time to move quickly, swiftly and efficiently onto other tasks.\", \"publisher\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Quickler\", \"url\": \"https://quickler.co/\"}}, {\"@type\": \"VideoObject\", \"name\": \"Graeme Clark, Ethos Safety: \\u201cIt was deceptively easy.\\u201d\", \"description\": \"Graeme Clark, Director at Ethos Safety, on how easy it was to capture the data on site with Quickler.\", \"thumbnailUrl\": [\"https://videos.quickler.co/graeme-deceptively-easy-v3-thumb.jpg\"], \"uploadDate\": \"2026-11-23\", \"duration\": \"PT29S\", \"contentUrl\": \"https://videos.quickler.co/graeme-deceptively-easy-v3.mp4\", \"embedUrl\": \"https://quickler.co/graeme/\", \"inLanguage\": \"en-GB\", \"transcript\": \"I think it was deceptively easy. And what I mean by deceptively easy is it didn't feel like we were doing enough on site to capture the data that we desired. It felt almost like we weren't putting enough effort in using Quickler because it was deceptively easy to capture the data by purely just describing it or just taking a short series of photographs.\", \"publisher\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Quickler\", \"url\": \"https://quickler.co/\"}}, {\"@type\": \"VideoObject\", \"name\": \"Graeme Clark, Ethos Safety: \\u201cA COSHH assessment in a tenth of the time.\\u201d\", \"description\": \"Graeme Clark, Director at Ethos Safety, on the difference it makes to be asked for 10 COSHH assessments.\", \"thumbnailUrl\": [\"https://videos.quickler.co/graeme-coshh-in-a-tenth-of-the-time-thumb.jpg\"], \"uploadDate\": \"2026-11-25\", \"duration\": \"PT29S\", \"contentUrl\": \"https://videos.quickler.co/graeme-coshh-in-a-tenth-of-the-time.mp4\", \"embedUrl\": \"https://quickler.co/graeme/\", \"inLanguage\": \"en-GB\", \"transcript\": \"You phoned today and said, I need 10 COSHH assessments, I'd be perfectly polite on the phone. And I would say, yeah, that's absolutely something that I can do for you. But then when the phone went down inwardly, I would think, gee, I've got to do 10 COSHH assessments and your heart would sink a small amount. And you would think, you know, the first one or two obviously are quite interesting, but then you've just got to do the same thing 10 times. But we've got a COSHH assessment in a tenth of the time.\", \"publisher\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Quickler\", \"url\": \"https://quickler.co/\"}}, {\"@type\": \"VideoObject\", \"name\": \"Graeme Clark, Ethos Safety: \\u201cWe\\u2019re not there to write a list of faults.\\u201d\", \"description\": \"Graeme Clark, Director at Ethos Safety, on spending the time saved changing people\\u2019s behaviour on health and safety.\", \"thumbnailUrl\": [\"https://videos.quickler.co/graeme-not-a-list-of-faults-thumb.jpg\"], \"uploadDate\": \"2026-11-23\", \"duration\": \"PT31S\", \"contentUrl\": \"https://videos.quickler.co/graeme-not-a-list-of-faults.mp4\", \"embedUrl\": \"https://quickler.co/graeme/\", \"inLanguage\": \"en-GB\", \"transcript\": \"We spend the rest of the remaining time interacting with people, which is what we're there to do. We're there to actually change people's behaviours on health and safety. We're not there to write a list of faults or a list of problems because that's neither constructive nor helpful to our clients. So what we can do with Quickler is we can quickly illustrate the topics and we can physically give them a report that is easy for them to interact with.\", \"publisher\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Quickler\", \"url\": \"https://quickler.co/\"}}, {\"@type\": \"VideoObject\", \"name\": \"Graeme Clark, Ethos Safety: \\u201cAn absolute boon to the way that we use Quickler on site.\\u201d\", \"description\": \"Graeme Clark, Director at Ethos Safety, on the to-do list at the top, which can be copied into a WhatsApp message and sent on to a site team.\", \"thumbnailUrl\": [\"https://videos.quickler.co/graeme-the-to-do-list-at-the-top-thumb.jpg\"], \"uploadDate\": \"2026-11-25\", \"duration\": \"PT28S\", \"contentUrl\": \"https://videos.quickler.co/graeme-the-to-do-list-at-the-top.mp4\", \"embedUrl\": \"https://quickler.co/graeme/\", \"inLanguage\": \"en-GB\", \"transcript\": \"One of the greatest innovations of Quickler is the to-do list at the top, which is easily copyable to another WhatsApp message that they can then send on to their site team. And we've seen people do that. When we actually point that out to some of our clients is you can just press copy and the to-do list of all the things that you need to action can just be instantly sent. We see that as being an absolute boon to the way that we use Quickler on site.\", \"publisher\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Quickler\", \"url\": \"https://quickler.co/\"}}, {\"@type\": \"VideoObject\", \"name\": \"Graeme Clark, Ethos Safety: \\u201cPeople have adopted to the shareable link particularly well.\\u201d\", \"description\": \"Graeme Clark, Director at Ethos Safety, on why his firm stopped sending both the PDF and the shareable link.\", \"thumbnailUrl\": [\"https://videos.quickler.co/graeme-the-shareable-link-thumb.jpg\"], \"uploadDate\": \"2026-11-25\", \"duration\": \"PT30S\", \"contentUrl\": \"https://videos.quickler.co/graeme-the-shareable-link.mp4\", \"embedUrl\": \"https://quickler.co/graeme/\", \"inLanguage\": \"en-GB\", \"transcript\": \"Predominantly in my business, being a compliance business, change always isn't an easy sell. So we were careful and we were cautious and we actually approached a couple of our key clients who were planning to use as a bit of an early adoption test bed. Initially we sent them both the PDF and the shareable link. However, we've stopped doing that. We've actually found that people have adopted to the shareable link particularly well.\", \"publisher\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Quickler\", \"url\": \"https://quickler.co/\"}}, {\"@type\": \"VideoObject\", \"name\": \"Graeme Clark, Ethos Safety: \\u201cIt\\u2019s dead easy once they actually look over your shoulder.\\u201d\", \"description\": \"Graeme Clark, Director at Ethos Safety, on how clients react when they see WhatsApp used for work.\", \"thumbnailUrl\": [\"https://videos.quickler.co/graeme-whatsapp-as-work-thumb.jpg\"], \"uploadDate\": \"2026-11-25\", \"duration\": \"PT29S\", \"contentUrl\": \"https://videos.quickler.co/graeme-whatsapp-as-work.mp4\", \"embedUrl\": \"https://quickler.co/graeme/\", \"inLanguage\": \"en-GB\", \"transcript\": \"What they are sometimes a little bit cautious of is how can WhatsApp be a work activity? And it's dead easy once they actually look over your shoulder and see what you're doing on WhatsApp and the familiarity with WhatsApp. People will look at it and go, well, that's what he's doing with it. I've yet to come across somebody who then when you show it to them, asks you the follow up question, which is what's WhatsApp?\", \"publisher\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Quickler\", \"url\": \"https://quickler.co/\"}}, {\"@type\": \"VideoObject\", \"name\": \"Graeme Clark, Ethos Safety: \\u201cThe result is really much better.\\u201d\", \"description\": \"Graeme Clark, Director at Ethos Safety, on how longer, more explanatory voice notes give a much better result.\", \"thumbnailUrl\": [\"https://videos.quickler.co/graeme-longer-voice-notes-thumb.jpg\"], \"uploadDate\": \"2026-11-25\", \"duration\": \"PT34S\", \"contentUrl\": \"https://videos.quickler.co/graeme-longer-voice-notes.mp4\", \"embedUrl\": \"https://quickler.co/graeme/\", \"inLanguage\": \"en-GB\", \"transcript\": \"Initially, we were quite terse with it. So we didn't give it a huge amount of information when we were giving a voice note for a particular subject. Now we're probably adding two or three sentences to that voice note. So we're being quite explanatory. We're being quite specific. And that's a change. We're giving it sometimes 30, 40 second voice notes. Whereas before we were giving it five and 10 second voice notes. But in reality, with a longer, more explanatory, descriptive voice notes, the result is really much better.\", \"publisher\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Quickler\", \"url\": \"https://quickler.co/\"}}, {\"@type\": \"VideoObject\", \"name\": \"Graeme Clark, Ethos Safety: The main film\", \"description\": \"A film of Graeme Clark, Director at Ethos Safety, on writing up site inspections with Quickler.\", \"thumbnailUrl\": [\"https://videos.quickler.co/graeme-main-film-thumb.jpg\"], \"uploadDate\": \"2026-11-25\", \"duration\": \"PT2M12S\", \"contentUrl\": \"https://videos.quickler.co/graeme-main-film-720.mp4\", \"embedUrl\": \"https://quickler.co/graeme/\", \"inLanguage\": \"en-GB\", \"publisher\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Quickler\", \"url\": \"https://quickler.co/\"}}, {\"@type\": \"VideoObject\", \"name\": \"Graeme Clark, Ethos Safety: The 3-minute film\", \"description\": \"A longer film of Graeme Clark, Director at Ethos Safety, on writing up site inspections with Quickler.\", \"thumbnailUrl\": [\"https://videos.quickler.co/graeme-3-minute-film-thumb.jpg\"], \"uploadDate\": \"2026-11-25\", \"duration\": \"PT3M40S\", \"contentUrl\": \"https://videos.quickler.co/graeme-3-minute-film-720.mp4\", \"embedUrl\": \"https://quickler.co/graeme/\", \"inLanguage\": \"en-GB\", \"publisher\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Quickler\", \"url\": \"https://quickler.co/\"}}, {\"@type\": \"VideoObject\", \"name\": \"Graeme Clark, Ethos Safety: The long film\", \"description\": \"The long film of Graeme Clark, Director at Ethos Safety, on writing up site inspections with Quickler.\", \"thumbnailUrl\": [\"https://videos.quickler.co/graeme-long-film-thumb.jpg\"], \"uploadDate\": \"2026-11-25\", \"duration\": \"PT19M18S\", \"contentUrl\": \"https://videos.quickler.co/graeme-long-film-720.mp4\", \"embedUrl\": \"https://quickler.co/graeme/\", \"inLanguage\": \"en-GB\", \"publisher\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Quickler\", \"url\": \"https://quickler.co/\"}}]}</script>",
